                                        "entry_id": "8563b05d-24b8-350d-bb25-ace5840492b0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A form of heavy-rail rapid-transit system that utilizes modern Electric Multiple Units to transport commuters between stations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "India",
                                            "Malaysia",
